//                       * gate[b, h] )            (t = i*block + j, t<seq_len)
//
// Same computation / contract as dsa_topk_logits_cpu (the oracle, always
// compiled in dsa.cpp) and the HIP kernels in dsa.hip. The host oracle and
// the *_fits_lds* / *_split_for helpers are SHARED (always-compiled
// vkernels::kernels); this TU only adds the three device kernels + the
// CUDA dispatcher (mirroring how gemm_bf16.cu reuses gemm_bf16_config_for).
//
